- `qnView/src/commonMain/kotlin/com/tencent/news/core/compose/platform/IconFont.kt` (QnIconFont 组件)
- `qnCore/src/commonMain/kotlin/com/tencent/news/core/app/constants/IconFont.kt` (IconFont 枚举定义)

